        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Community colleges should expand culturally tailored supports for male students of color despite mixed persistence evidence.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "9b1f76ff9711404c861e59dc3fa7d037"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "MSSI’s randomized evaluation improved enrollment and passing in its first-semester course and found a later fourth-semester grade effect for early cohorts. It found no significant first-semester credits effect, documented inconsistent implementation and pandemic disruption, and could not determine cost effectiveness.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
